# Shadow Trace

## Overview

This room focused on analyzing a suspicious file, uncovering embedded indicators of compromise, and tracing alert activity back to malicious infrastructure. It combined alert triage against a static site with static analysis of a suspicious binary (windows-update.exe) to pull out identifying details, IOCs, and a hidden flag.

